  "product": {
    "id": 7588133470462,
    "title": "(AMZN-NLN) Soundpeats Sonic PRO, VGP 2021 SUMMER COSPA Award, Dual BA Drivers, aptX Adaptive / AAC Codec Supported, Wireless Charging, QCC3040 Chipset, Low Latency, Game Mode, Dual Balanced Armature Driver, Bluetooth 5.2 Earphones, IPX5 Waterproof",
    "body_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-mce-style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ff2a00;\">As our store also sell on amazon, we do receive returns from the customers by stating reason as \"No longer needed\" called as AMZN-NLN. The products sold in this collection are UNUSED, in almost new - 100% working condition. So, here is an opportunity for our customers to experience the best at deeply discounted prices :)</span></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\" data-mce-style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><strong data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2g0o.detail.1000023.i0.366d41bftXEVJp\" style=\"font-weight: 700 !important;\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 700 !important;\">Compared with Sonic,What are the technical upgrades of SoundPEATS Sonic Pro?</strong></p>\n<ol>\n<li>Wireless Charging Compatible:Simply place the charging case on a wireless charging pad for convenient charging.</li>\n<li>Dual Balanced Armature Driver:Upgrade the single dynamic to dual balanced armature driver, which greatly improves the sound quality. First: Based on the characteristics of balanced armature, we focus on human voices, which are highly reductive, sweet and extreme; second: the energy of the balanced armature unit is large, so that the earphone has sufficient volume, strong energy and full sound;</li>\n</ol>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br></p>\n<ul style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\n<li><span>[Bluetooth 5.2 &amp; QCC3040 Chipset]- Adopt advanced Bluetooth 5.2 and built-in high-tech QCC 3040 chipset, SoundPEATS Sonic is compatible with all the Bluetooth devices enable with Bluetooth 4.0 or above and provides you truly wireless enjoyment with seamless connection and lower consumption. You can choose either earbud at a time for calls or music, switch freely between single and twin mode.</span></li>\n<li><span>[Immersive Bass &amp; Clear Call]- To bring you an unparalleled audio feast, SoundPEATS Sonic wireless earbuds adopt low frequency enhancement technology and latest aptx-adaptive audio decoding technology to deliver fantastic immersive sound with powerful bass. Combined with Qualcomm CVC 8.0 noise reduction functionality, you\u2019ll experience a whole new world of crystal-clear phone calls.</span></li>\n<li><span>[35 Hrs Playtime &amp; USB-C Charge]- Taking with SoundPEATS Sonic bluetooth earbuds, you can enjoy music wherever you go as it offers up to 15 hours playtime on a single full charge and pocket sized charging case extends playtime up to 35 hours and supports up to 2 full charges for the earbuds, it only takes 1.5 hrs to charge the case with type-C quick charge.</span></li>\n<li><span>[TrueWireless Mirroring &amp; Game Mode]- The advanced TrueWireless Mirroring technology aims to maximize the connection stability and reduce the audio interruption under the poor radio frequency circumstance, you will feel no signal loss or music dropouts during listening and calling no matter indoor or outdoor. The game mode minimizes the delay to ensure the synchronization of the game audio and picture (Triple tap MFB on left earbud to enter the Game mode).</span></li>\n<li><span>[Easy Control &amp; Comfortable Fit]- Compared to the smart touch control, the sensitive button control provides more precise control for what you want. Softly tap on the earbud to skip songs, adjust volume, answer/reject calls and activate Siri without picking up your phone. In-ear ergonomic design and three different sizes of eartips bring you most comfortable wearing.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span>Specification:</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span>1.Sensitivity: 114\u00b13dB</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span>2.Resistance: 30\u03a9</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span>3.Frequency Response Range: 20-20000Hz</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span>4.Codecs: SBC\u3001 ACC\u3001APTX\u3001 APTX-adaptive</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span>5.Active Noise-Cancellation: No</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span>6.Bluetooth Version: Bluetooth 5.2</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span>7.Bluetooth Prole: HSP \u3001HFP \u3001 A2DP\u3001AVRCP</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span>8.Bluetooth Chipset: QCC3040</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span>9.Maximun Working Range: 33feet/10m(no abstacle)</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span>10.Playing Time: About 15 Hours (volume at 60%)</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span>11.Earbuds Charging Time: About 1.5 hours</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span>12.Case Charging Time: 1.5 Hours</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span>13.Charging Case Recharge Earbuds: 2 times</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span>14.Earbud Power Capacity: 70mah</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span>15.Charging Case Power Capacity: 400mah</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span>16.Earbud Dimension(L*W*H): 0.72*0.8*1.07in/18.3*20.5*27.2mm</span></p>\n<p style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-mce-style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><span>17.Charging Case Dimension(L*W*H): 61*38.95